950..1026 Comment "/// The left inverse\'s round trip through the forward map, at `y`: the right"
1027..1105 Comment "/// inverse\'s round trip at `y` carried back along the left inverse, joined to"
1106..1182 Comment "/// the left inverse\'s round trip at `h(y)`, makes the two inverses agree at"
1183..1253 Comment "/// `y`; carried along the forward map, that agreement turns the right"
1254..1331 Comment "/// inverse\'s round trip into the left one\'s. Each map is stated as `a => b`,"
1332..1391 Comment "/// which `cong` reads as it reads `+U (a -> -F b)` (#791)."
